<title>POLAND: OKOCIM 96 NET RISES TO PLN 27.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>OKOCIM 96 NET RISES TO PLN 27.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.51 vs   0.75</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.22 vs   0.08 (loss)</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.85 vs   0.24</p>
